{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたっ（ ;  ; ）！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都全国握手会、個別握手会おわりました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握のペアは美彩先輩と！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/08/6577381/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美彩のファンの皆さんも本当に優しくて楽しく握手できました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はぁ～、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/08/6577381/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/08/6577381/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュタッ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい能條Tシャツを着ましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと握手会で着たいな～とは思ってたのですが\nいざきてみたら寒かった(￣▽￣)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/08/6577381/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょんじょんって書いてあるの❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあれらしいね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょんじょんってサンダルって意味らしいね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らなかったぁぁぁーーーー！！！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/08/6577381/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたあみあみ族のみんな、本当にありがとう❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、この間の乃木どこ、エイプリルクイーン企画に能條でさせていただいたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながらカットでしたが\nわたしも実は騙されてました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしていつものごとく番組冒頭で設楽さんに髪型のことでツッコまれました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは恒例なのでしょうか。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに乃木どこは今週も来週も出るのでよかったら観てね❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エイプリルフールといえば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなはだれかに嘘ついた？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはチームDや飛鳥やそしてファンの皆様にモバメをつかって嘘つかせていただきました❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親指の骨が折れたなどなど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春になったから髪の毛ピンク色に染めたなどなど......笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみのくだらない嘘に騙されてくれたのは飛鳥ちゃんだけでした。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く、小顔クイーンめ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/08/6577381/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/04/08/6577381/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから\n告知ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう発売されてますがSamurai ELOに少しでさせていただいてるのでよかったら見てください↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、アイドルプラネットさんに\nインタビュー記事を載せていただいてます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","tex